[05:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'rule-based. When a tool fires on every keystroke in your editor, predictability isn\'t a compromise, it\'s the whole feature. Harper is free, released every week or two, and it covers precisely the surfaces Grammarly will never see, your'

